<title>USA: HSBC, Wachovia in marketing pact.</title>
<headline>HSBC, Wachovia in marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Corp Monday said it formed an alliance with HSBC Holdings PLC to market corporate financial services globally.</p>
<p>The alliance will focus on the joint marketing of trade finance, cash management and corporate banking services.</p>
<p>HSBC and Wachovia will exchange personnel and jointly market select services by combining existing product capabilities and, on a limited basis, developing new services.</p>
<p>The alliance involves no equity investment by either party, Wachovia said.</p>
